,"created_at":"2026-05-26T07:17:00Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:07Z","closed_at":"2026-06-02T14:44:07Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in [4.7-beta3] [4.7-beta2] [4.7-beta1] [4.6.3 stable]\n\nnot reproducible in 4.5\n\n### System information\n\nLinux - vulkan forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\nanimations inside an animation tree with custom timelines in them don't call method functions\nrealized this when i loaded a project that used to work fine in 4.5\n\n<img width=\"620\" height=\"258\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdc8a044-56c4-4dea-8e40-f7a789ece571\" />\n\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"631\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2fe7e52-f211-4efe-b3b9-80116c2555d6\" />\n\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"631\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a58e95d3-6822-4fee-a54b-cd8ef11fe4c4\" />\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e9a90085-25a3-45ee-9f2b-c95cdc854f2c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n\ndownload the MRP project. \npress F to trigger the full animation the function gets called\npress H to trigger the half animation which is the same animation but starts from a marker in the middle using a custom timeline the function don't get called\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nDownload the MRP project. \npress F to trigger the full animation the function gets called\npress H to trigger the half animation which is the same animation but starts from a marker in the middle using a custom timeline the function don't get called\n\nsame animation is used to create two nodes. one with the full animation, the second one uses a custom timeline to start from a marker in the middle of the animation.\ntriggering the node that have the full animation will call the function in the method track, but the node with the half animation don't\n\n[MRP-customTimlineBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28252272/MRP-customTimlineBug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119769/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119769/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}